    "prompt": "A stylishly dressed man is captured mid-stride in a confident 45-degree stance with his weight dynamically shifted as he walks down a city street. He has slicked-back dark hair catching subtle specular highlights, a sharply groomed neat beard, and his eyes are concealed behind dark sunglasses as he looks away with a composed, closed-mouth expression. He wears a meticulously fitted {argument name=\"shirt color\" default=\"dark navy blue\"} dress shirt with rolled sleeves exposing a wristwatch and metal bracelet, paired with stark, crisp {argument name=\"trousers color\" default=\"white\"} tailored high-waisted trousers that create a striking high-contrast visual anchor, finished with a black belt and polished black leather loafers. His left hand is raised in a relaxed, deliberately posed gesture, with the thumb resting near his jawline while the index and middle fingers lightly press the outer shell of black over-ear headphones. His right arm extends downward, forearm muscles tense as he firmly grips the black telescoping handle of a matte black, vertically ribbed hard-shell rolling suitcase with dual spinner wheels. Directly beneath his feet in the foreground, a weathered, square textured iron manhole grate is set into the solid, dark asphalt-grey concrete street beside painted street markings. To his left in the midground, providing asymmetric balance, sits a dominant, pristine {argument name=\"vehicle color\" default=\"champagne metallic\"} luxury SUV featuring detailed multi-spoke alloy wheels and blacked-out windows, its glossy finish sharply reflecting the surrounding street. In the background at a medium spatial depth, a rough, weathered dark reddish-brown and gray brick wall with patchy white mortar lines meets a polished black stone entrance facade under a building awning. The sophisticated, polished urban atmosphere is illuminated by soft, diffused single-source natural daylight from an overcast sky above, casting short, gray shadows with soft gradual edges directly beneath the subject and the vehicle, while adding a subtle shadow from the man onto the ground. The lighting maintains a neutral, cool temperature with desaturated ambient fill, yielding striking specular highlights that bounce off the SUV's metallic paint and glass alongside soft gleams on the man's hair and leather footwear. Shot as a luxurious menswear and automotive lifestyle editorial digital photograph using a 50mm lens at f/4.0 to achieve a medium depth of field that keeps the subject and vehicle tack-sharp while gently softening the distant architecture, capturing the scene at 1/500s and ISO 200 to freeze the walking motion without grain, enhanced by post-processing with desaturated warm tones, subtle dodging on the face, and crisp textural sharpening, all flawlessly framed in a 3:4 aspect ratio.",
